@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### Saúde
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Criar despesa (cada execução cria outro registro)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Mercado","amount":35.90,"category":"GROCERIES","occurredOn":"2026-01-10"}

### Resumo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/summary?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-01-31

### Categoria
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-01-31&category=GROCERIES

### Valor inválido: deve retornar 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Inválida","amount":0,"category":"FOOD","occurredOn":"2026-01-10"}

### Consulta de IA (perfil ai e chave necessários)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assistant/text
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Quanto gastei de 1 a 31 de janeiro de 2026? Resuma por categoria."}
